{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08015","headline":"春日行 · 李白","name":"春日行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"深宫高楼入紫清，金作蛟龙盘绣楹。\n佳人当窗弄白日，弦将手语弹鸣筝。\n春风吹落君王耳，此曲乃是昇天行。\n因出天池泛蓬瀛，楼船蹙沓波浪惊。\n三千双蛾献歌笑，挝钟考鼓宫殿倾。\n万姓聚舞歌太平，我无爲，人自宁。\n三十六帝欲相迎，仙人飘翩下云軿。\n帝不去，留镐京。\n安能爲轩辕，独往入窅冥。\n小臣拜献南山寿，陛下万古垂鸿名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08015.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08015","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}